   "end": 509.4,
   "text": "Jib Jinping breaks taboo and enters the Forbidden City."
  },
  {
   "start": 510.04,
   "end": 511.68,
   "text": "So anyways, let's go to the end, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 511.76,
   "end": 512.88,
   "text": "I have 34 pages."
  },
  {
   "start": 512.88,
   "end": 517.44,
   "text": "And yeah, so the biggest is Decline and Fall."
  },
  {
   "start": 517.64,
   "end": 518.5,
   "text": "Here, I'll even show you."
  },
  {
   "start": 519.22,
   "end": 524.43,
   "text": "Let's make this darker so you can see."
  },
  {
   "start": 524.87,
   "end": 529.96,
   "text": "Fall, biggest."
  },
  {
   "start": 530.48,
   "end": 533.93,
   "text": "Slave Narrative, second biggest."
  },
  {
   "start": 534.57,
   "end": 535.61,
   "text": "Decline and Fall is..."
  },
  {
   "start": 537.05,
   "end": 538.47,
   "text": "126 hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 539.55,
   "end": 541.83,
   "text": "And almost as big, 115 hours, Slave Narrative."
  },
  {
   "start": 543.45,
   "end": 544.57,
   "text": "Oh, wow, almost as big."
  },
  {
   "start": 544.97,
   "end": 545.73,
   "text": "113 hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 546.05,
   "end": 546.53,
   "text": "Mythology."
  },
  {
   "start": 546.81,
   "end": 547.41,
   "text": "Oh, that's cool."
  },
  {
   "start": 547.53,
   "end": 548.07,
   "text": "Ain't it myth?"
  },
  {
   "start": 548.13,
   "end": 548.83,
   "text": "113 hours?"
  },
  {
   "start": 549.55,
   "end": 550.21,
   "text": "So I'm gonna listen..."
  },
  {
   "start": 550.21,
   "end": 551.79,
   "text": "I can listen to all these on my computer."
  },
  {
   "start": 552.65,
   "end": 553.33,
   "text": "I think so."
  },
  {
   "start": 554.41,
   "end": 555.45,
   "text": "Because my phone won't do it."
  },
  {
   "start": 555.49,
   "end": 556.59,
   "text": "And then there's Karl Marx Capital,"
  },
  {
   "start": 556.71,
   "end": 559.59,
   "text": "Which I have actually listened to before on Letterboxd."
  },
  {
   "start": 561.37,
   "end": 562.17,
   "text": "History of Rome."
  },
  {
   "start": 562.45,
   "end": 563.59,
   "text": "Olivia, which I've listened to."
  },
  {
   "start": 563.69,
   "end": 564.23,
   "text": "89 hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 564.35,
   "end": 565.49,
   "text": "Carol, Elijah, Scripture, Romans."
  },
  {
   "start": 566.95,
   "end": 567.67,
   "text": "83 hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 567.81,
   "end": 568.27,
   "text": "Holy..."
  },
  {
   "start": 568.27,
   "end": 568.93,
   "text": "The Bible."
  },
  {
   "start": 570.53,
   "end": 571.09,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 571.09,
   "end": 573.31,
   "text": "Marlboro, His Life and Times."
  },
  {
   "start": 575.07,
   "end": 575.95,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 575.95,
   "end": 583.73,
   "text": "By switching it,"
  },
  {
   "start": 583.73,
   "end": 586.03,
   "text": "It took me to the first page."
  },
  {
   "start": 587.95,
   "end": 589.95,
   "text": "So, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 589.95,
   "end": 592.33,
   "text": "Holy Bible, Summa Theologica."
  },
  {
   "start": 592.55,
   "end": 594.33,
   "text": "So, this is 66 hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 594.49,
   "end": 597.19,
   "text": "That's the biggest book my phone will play."
  },
  {
   "start": 598.21,
   "end": 601.11,
   "text": "But if I go over here to, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 601.11,
   "end": 601.77,
   "text": "To The Sucker,"
  },
  {
   "start": 601.97,
   "end": 603.23,
   "text": "Which I'd love to hear on here."
  },
  {
   "start": 604.05,
   "end": 604.57,
   "text": "Mythology."
  },
  {
   "start": 604.81,
   "end": 605.65,
   "text": "Let's see if it plays it."
  },
  {
   "start": 613.48,
   "end": 614.38,
   "text": "Look, it's playing."
  },
  {
   "start": 614.56,
   "end": 615.2,
   "text": "Oh, thank God."
  },
  {
   "start": 615.32,
   "end": 615.84,
   "text": "Oh, that's mine."
  },
  {
   "start": 616.86,
   "end": 618.1,
   "text": "So now I can listen to that"
  },
  {
   "start": 618.1,
   "end": 620.6,
   "text": "Because I can't think that I can play these on my computer."
  },
  {
   "start": 620.74,
   "end": 621.5,
   "text": "I keep thinking I could..."
  },
  {
   "start": 621.5,
   "end": 622.86,
   "text": "I only play it on my phone."
  },
  {
   "start": 623.22,
   "end": 624.04,
   "text": "It plays on my computer."
  },
  {
   "start": 625.82,
   "end": 626.98,
   "text": "So, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 626.98,
   "end": 628.12,
   "text": "You know what doesn't play"
  },
  {
   "start": 628.12,
   "end": 630.94,
   "text": "Is on your computer or your phone"
  },
  {
   "start": 630.94,
   "end": 632.5,
   "text": "Or anywhere other than a Kindle."
  },
  {
   "start": 633.24,
   "end": 634.06,
   "text": "There's Kindle books,"
  },
  {
   "start": 634.1,
   "end": 635.08,
   "text": "Which drives me crazy"
  },
  {
   "start": 635.08,
   "end": 637.0,
   "text": "Because I have such a big Kindle library,"
  },
  {
   "start": 637.12,
   "end": 637.48,
   "text": "But whatever."
  },
  {
   "start": 638.32,
   "end": 639.18,
   "text": "And Kindles are big,"
  },
  {
   "start": 639.24,
   "end": 639.68,
   "text": "You know what I mean?"
  },
  {
   "start": 640.4,
   "end": 640.64,
   "text": "It's like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 640.68,
   "end": 641.74,
   "text": "At least make a small Kindle"
  },
  {
   "start": 641.74,
   "end": 642.8,
   "text": "If that's the only thing that reads,"
  },
  {
   "start": 642.88,
   "end": 643.8,
   "text": "But..."
  },
  {
   "start": 643.8,
   "end": 644.8,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 647.53,
   "end": 648.37,
   "text": "But, um, anyway,"
  },
  {
   "start": 648.49,
   "end": 649.99,
   "text": "So I'm doing Summa Theologica."
  },
  {
   "start": 651.07,
   "end": 652.59,
   "text": "And then I guess this will be the next one."
  },
  {
   "start": 653.13,
   "end": 654.79,
   "text": "I don't want to mix too many big ones together,"
  },
  {
   "start": 654.91,
   "end": 655.57,
   "text": "But..."
  },
  {
   "start": 655.57,
   "end": 656.23,
   "text": "I could fill it up"
  },
  {
   "start": 656.23,
   "end": 658.49,
   "text": "With a little itty-bitty, so..."
  },
  {
   "start": 658.49,
   "end": 661.49,
   "text": "Anyways, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 661.49,
   "end": 663.25,
   "text": "I, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 663.25,
   "end": 670.5,
   "text": "Super, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 670.5,
   "end": 670.98,
   "text": "Broke,"
  },
  {
   "start": 671.06,
   "end": 674.1,
   "text": "But I still own myself"
  },
  {
   "start": 674.1,
   "end": 675.54,
   "text": "And I blew 270 bucks"
  },
  {
   "start": 675.54,
   "end": 677.9,
   "text": "On Matchbox cars."
  },
  {
   "start": 679.68,
   "end": 680.94,
   "text": "Because I have these"
  },
  {
   "start": 680.94,
   "end": 681.58,
   "text": "That are empty"
  },
  {
   "start": 681.58,
   "end": 682.46,
   "text": "And I bought them"
  },
  {
   "start": 682.46,
   "end": 684.06,
   "text": "Because you see them"
  },
  {
   "start": 684.06,
   "end": 685.76,
   "text": "I have four of the cases."
  },
  {
   "start": 685.98,
   "end": 687.48,
   "text": "Each one holds 56 cars,"
  },
  {
   "start": 687.64,
   "end": 689.12,
   "text": "So I can have cases"
  },
  {
   "start": 689.12,
   "end": 691.04,
   "text": "That hold 56 times 4,"
  },
  {
   "start": 691.16,
   "end": 692.88,
   "text": "Which is 224 cars."
  },
  {
   "start": 694.06,
   "end": 695.26,
   "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 695.26,
   "end": 697.78,
   "text": "Right on the back end of my shower."
  },
  {
   "start": 698.5,
   "end": 699.66,
   "text": "So when you're showering,"
  },
  {
   "start": 699.76,
   "end": 700.38,
   "text": "You can see them"
  },
  {
   "start": 700.38,
   "end": 701.7,
   "text": "Or if you're taking a bath."
  },
  {
   "start": 702.72,
   "end": 703.48,
   "text": "So that's cool."
  },
  {
   "start": 703.6,
   "end": 704.44,
   "text": "And you stack them up"
  },
  {
   "start": 704.44,
   "end": 705.42,
   "text": "So even on the top"
  },
  {
   "start": 705.42,
   "end": 706.76,
   "text": "You can still kind of see the car."
  },
  {
   "start": 706.76,
   "end": 708.84,
   "text": "And if I have..."
  },
  {
   "start": 708.84,
   "end": 710.02,
   "text": "And I might get more"
  },
  {
   "start": 710.02,
   "end": 710.88,
   "text": "For, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 711.28,
   "end": 713.08,
   "text": "The, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 713.08,
   "end": 713.78,
   "text": "Like, put down"
  },
  {
   "start": 713.78,
   "end": 714.5,
   "text": "On other places."
  },
  {
   "start": 716.22,
   "end": 717.02,
   "text": "And I have these"
  },
  {
   "start": 717.02,
   "end": 717.68,
   "text": "Really cheap ones"
  },
  {
   "start": 717.68,
   "end": 718.06,
   "text": "That I bought"
  },
  {
   "start": 718.06,
   "end": 719.04,
   "text": "Like a pack of 100."
  },
  {
   "start": 720.42,
   "end": 721.16,
   "text": "And I was thinking about"
  },
  {
   "start": 721.16,
   "end": 722.48,
   "text": "Gluing them"
  },
  {
   "start": 722.48,
   "end": 724.38,
   "text": "To my flower pots"
  },
  {
   "start": 724.38,
   "end": 726.06,
   "text": "To have kind of like"
  },
  {
   "start": 726.06,
   "end": 727.44,
   "text": "A three-dimensional art thing."
  },
  {
   "start": 727.44,
   "end": 730.3,
   "text": "This is whenever I get around"
  },
  {
   "start": 730.3,
   "end": 732.74,
   "text": "To organizing my apartment."
  },
  {
   "start": 733.76,
   "end": 735.08,
   "text": "When I have the next..."
  },
  {
   "start": 735.08,
   "end": 736.66,
   "text": "I'm buying all the things slowly."
  },
  {
   "start": 737.38,
   "end": 738.32,
   "text": "And then when I have the time"
  },
  {
   "start": 738.32,
   "end": 739.42,
   "text": "Like when I need exercise,"
  },
  {
   "start": 739.64,
   "end": 740.68,
   "text": "That's how I do my exercise."
  },
  {
   "start": 741.32,
   "end": 742.72,
   "text": "And it'll be like a month or two"
  },
  {
   "start": 742.72,
   "end": 744.26,
   "text": "Of just working, working, working"
  },
  {
   "start": 744.26,
   "end": 745.0,
   "text": "And renovating"
  },
  {
   "start": 745.0,
   "end": 747.04,
   "text": "And, like, leveling it up"
  },
  {
   "start": 747.04,
   "end": 747.9,
   "text": "And making it, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 747.94,
   "end": 749.06,
   "text": "An art project."
  },
  {
   "start": 749.76,
   "end": 751.06,
   "text": "And the eventual goal"
  },
  {
   "start": 751.06,
   "end": 751.8,
   "text": "Is to"
  },
  {
   "start": 751.8,
   "end": 754.42,
   "text": "Have just a shitload of animals,"
  },
  {
   "start": 754.42,
   "end": 755.86,
   "text": "Like a ridiculous number"
  },
  {
   "start": 755.86,
   "end": 756.44,
   "text": "Of animals."
  },
  {
   "start": 758.0,
   "end": 758.56,
   "text": "And..."
  },
  {
   "start": 758.56,
   "end": 759.32,
   "text": "As well as plants."
  },
  {
   "start": 759.54,
   "end": 760.72,
   "text": "That's just plants everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 762.38,
   "end": 763.38,
   "text": "Plants and animals everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 763.52,
   "end": 764.42,
   "text": "Like, totally unreal..."
  },
  {
   "start": 764.42,
   "end": 765.4,
   "text": "Like, unreasonable."
  },
  {
   "start": 766.32,
   "end": 767.74,
   "text": "But by then, I'll be, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 767.9,
   "end": 768.46,
   "text": "Balanced."
  },
  {
   "start": 768.98,
   "end": 770.02,
   "text": "And, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 770.02,
   "end": 770.76,
   "text": "That's my pizza."
  },
  {
   "start": 771.64,
   "end": 772.48,
   "text": "And be able to, like,"
  },
  {
   "start": 772.58,
   "end": 773.32,
   "text": "Maintain it all."
  },
  {
   "start": 773.38,
   "end": 774.42,
   "text": "As long as I'm not smoking weed"
  },
  {
   "start": 774.42,
   "end": 774.82,
   "text": "All the time"
  },
  {
   "start": 774.82,
   "end": 775.44,
   "text": "Working on my website."
  },
  {
   "start": 776.02,
   "end": 776.88,
   "text": "Like, I could be an athlete"
  },
  {
   "start": 776.88,
   "end": 778.42,
   "text": "And maintain that stuff, I think."
  },
  {
   "start": 779.02,
   "end": 780.16,
   "text": "Anyways, that's my pizza."
  },
  {
   "start": 780.36,
   "end": 781.7,
   "text": "I'm gonna go have some dinner."
  },
  {
   "start": 782.26,
   "end": 782.94,
   "text": "Talk to you tomorrow."
  }
 ]
}